{"id":66722,"date":"2025-09-06T12:09:47","date_gmt":"2025-09-06T11:09:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=66722"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:49:10","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:49:10","slug":"trail-vitoriano","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-vitoriano\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Vitoriano 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Vitoriano 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Vitoriano 2026<\/strong> (10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o comemorativa) realiza-se no dia <strong>15 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partidas e chegadas em frente \u00e0 sede do Vit\u00f3ria Futebol Clube Ermidense, na vila de <strong>Ermidas-Sado<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Santiago do Cac\u00e9m<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>. O evento percorre caminhos rurais e trilhos florestais de grande beleza pela regi\u00e3o alentejana e a envolvente hist\u00f3rica do Lousal.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa integra o desafiante <strong>Trail Longo de 21 km<\/strong>, o din\u00e2mico <strong>Trail Curto de 13 km<\/strong> e uma <strong>Caminhada de 13 km<\/strong> aberta a todas as idades, todas com partida simult\u00e2nea \u00e0s 09:30 e tempo limite de 3 horas. Os atletas t\u00eam direito a dorsal, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica e almo\u00e7o\/conv\u00edvio t\u00edpico ap\u00f3s a corrida.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da Sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do <strong>Vit\u00f3ria Futebol Clube Ermidense (VFCE)<\/strong>, com o apoio dos <strong>Munic\u00edpios de Santiago do Cac\u00e9m e Gr\u00e2ndola<\/strong> e das Juntas de Freguesia locais.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-wei